@startuml

salt
{
  <b>FX FEED: EUR/USD</b> | [ Back to feeds ] | ^valid^
  --
  {#
    Identity | Value
    Base currency | EUR - Euro
    Quote currency | USD - US Dollar
    ORE key | FX/RATE/EUR/USD (derived)
    Source name | EURUSD-SYNTH
    Description | Synthetic EUR/USD spot feed, London session
    Enabled | ^enabled^
    Auto-start | ^no^
    Version | 4
  }
  --
  {#
    Price behaviour | Value
    Engine | ^geometric^
    New price every | 300 s = 12 ticks/hour
    Initial price | 1.0850
    Drift (mu) | 0.010 %
    Volatility (sigma) | 0.450 %
    Price source | ^fixed^
    Vintage | none
  }
  --
  {#
    Mixture (gmm_component) | # | Description | mean | stdev | w
    . | 0 | Normal-profile body | -0.010 | 0.350 | 0.70
    . | 1 | Fat left tail | -0.550 | 0.900 | 0.20
    . | 2 | Right-skew burst | 0.600 | 0.550 | 0.10
  }
  Weight Sum = 1.00 (normalised on save)
  [ Add process ] | [ Remove ] | [ Restore a single Normal-profile component ]
  --
  Return distribution
  f(x) = sum of w_i . N(x; mu_i, sigma_i)
  Return per update (%) from -1.61 to +2.80; the bold curve is the mixture,
  the dashed curves are its three weighted components.
  --
  Sample paths
  Paths 8 | Seed 20260727 | [ Reseed ]
  Price 1.0700 to 1.1000 over 60 steps; the seed forces the same batch
  until Reseed is pressed.
  --
  Validation
  ^ok^ Base and quote must be valid currency codes.
  ^ok^ Base and quote currencies must differ.
  ^ok^ Weight Sum = 1.00 (normalised on save)
  The screen reports each rule as it stands. Save is blocked while any rule fails.
  --
  {#
    Provenance | Value
    modified_by | marco
    performed_by | ores.synthetic.service
    Change reason | Add a synthetic EUR/USD spot feed for the London session.
  }
  --
  [ Save feed ] | [ History ] | [ Delete ]
  --
  Not started: ticks begin only when the feed is enabled and a running feed is asked for.
}

@enduml
